<title>UK: London silver fixes easier at 475.90 cents.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes easier at 475.90 cents.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 475.90 cents vs 481.35 cents previously. Spike higher Friday failed. Needs to get through 492.00 cents to signal upward potential.</p>
<p>GOLD - Little changed all morning at $343.90/$344.40, down 10 cents. Quiet and cautious. Resistance at $345.50.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Quiet at $450.00/$455.00 down $14.00</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Also quiet, easier at $205.00/$210.00 down $16.00.</p>
</text>
